Cat mahal meskipun demikian .

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:20.170
Pemilik :

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:25.260
Para pelanggan datang .

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:43.500
Sudah waktunya untuk cuaca malam .

00:10:44.240 --> 00:10:48.460
Aku terbang di atas pusat badai Mei Hua.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:06.210
Kami , wartawan di Hamamatsu Weather Attack ,

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:09.090
